<title>INDIA: Three killed in gas cylinder explosion in Delhi.</title>
<headline>Three killed in gas cylinder explosion in Delhi.</headline>
<dateline>NEW DELHI 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Three people were killed and another three injured when a gas cylinder exploded in a chemicals factory in New Delhi on Wednesday, police officials said.</p>
<p>The blast brought the building down, burying the victims.</p>
<p>The cause of the blast, near the Delhi University area in the northern part of the city, was not immediately known.</p>
